DESCRIPTION >
    Setup & Health: pageview count, trailing 30d. Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of setup-doctor.js's queryHogQL
    call at api/lib/setup-doctor.js:59 (queryName 'doctor_pageviews_30d').
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id,
    event -> event_type. No JSON-bag fields in this query.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE doctor_pageviews_30d_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS pageviews_30d
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY

TYPE endpoint
